            "sid": "MAT 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ee kake ayia! Ilasirak o lfarisayo isunkuro amu ishetishete inkuraren oo loibonok ninkodikodo inkuraren e lelo oiloonok le Nkai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nijojo, ‘Te naa ai kitii apa too nkolong'i oo loo Papa, anaata eitu kishulare ninche te nkibukoroto osarge loo loibonok.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitaa intae shakeni nchere irara inkera e lelo ootara lelo oibonok le Nkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emputa eneitong'oro iloo minyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
