              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore enkaraki ena, eng'urai airriwaki intae iloibonok o ltung'ana ng'eni o laiteng'enak loo nkitanapat; niariara kulikae, metuata nisheshe, niariara kulikae too nkajijik inyi e ntumo, niaraa kulikae too nkang'itie aaisikie; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
